tuations do people often have to wait?", "Why do some people find waiting difficult?", "Are people today less patient than people in the past? Why?", "How can shops or hospitals make waiting easier for people?"], "constructs": ["topic_development", "paraphrase", "lexical_precision", "grammatical_range", "connected_speech"], "min_seconds": 180, "max_seconds": 240}], "criteria": [{"key": "fluency_coherence", "label": "Fluency and Coherence", "focus": "Keep speaking, develop ideas and make your answer easy to follow."}, {"key": "lexical_resource", "label": "Lexical Resource", "focus": "Choose clear, suitable words and explain an idea another way when needed."}, {"key": "grammar_range_accuracy", "label": "Grammatical Range and Accuracy", "focus": "Use different sentence patterns and control grammar."}, {"key": "pronunciation", "label": "Pronunciation", "focus": "Make your meaning clear through sounds, stress, rhythm and intonation."}]}$content$::jsonb c) x;

